WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.369 line:85%
I landed on the Moon in 1967, before any human walked there!

2
00:00:06.459 --> 00:00:08.095 line:85%
I'm Surveyor 3.

3
00:00:08.185 --> 00:00:11.161 line:85%
My job was to test the lunar ground.

4
00:00:11.251 --> 00:00:15.546 line:85%
My tests showed the surface was solid enough to hold a lunar module.

5
00:00:15.636 --> 00:00:23.854 line:85%
Then, in November 1969, Apollo 12 landed about 180 meters away from me!

6
00:00:23.944 --> 00:00:26.506 line:85%
The astronauts walked over to visit.

7
00:00:26.596 --> 00:00:32.972 line:85%
They took my camera and scoop back to Earth, so scientists could study how the Moon had changed them.

8
00:00:33.062 --> 00:00:35.983 line:85%
Can you imagine getting visitors on the Moon?
